 "brief": "Israeli forces and settlers raided several villages across the West Bank on Thursday, concentrated in the governorates of Bethlehem, Nablus, Ramallah, and Jenin, Shehab Wire reported. The incursions involved attacks on Palestinian communities and the theft of olive crops during the harvest season.\n\nThe raid on the village of al-Rashaydeh east of Bethlehem was among the operations documented on the day, though details of damage and casualties remained under review as the situation developed across the affected areas.",
